<div class="container-xl py-4" id="kardexPage" data-product="{{product.id_producto}}" data-admin="{{esAdmin}}">
<a href="/inventario" class="btn btn-outline-secondary mb-3">Volver al inventario</a><h2>Kardex · {{product.nombre_producto}}</h2>
<div id="gestionError" class="alert alert-danger" hidden></div><p id="kardexInfo" class="alert alert-info"></p>
<form id="kardexFilters" class="row g-2 mb-3"><label class="col-md-3">Desde<input class="form-control" type="date" name="desde"></label><label class="col-md-3">Hasta<input class="form-control" type="date" name="hasta"></label><label class="col-md-4">Tipo<select name="tipo" class="form-select"><option value="">Todos</option><option>COMPRA</option><option>VENTA</option><option>AJUSTE_ENTRADA</option><option>AJUSTE_SALIDA</option><option>REVERSO_ENTRADA</option><option>REVERSO_SALIDA</option><option>APERTURA</option><option>CREACION</option><option>VALORIZACION</option></select></label><div class="col-md-2 align-self-end"><button class="btn btn-primary">Filtrar</button></div></form>
<p>Las cantidades se expresan en unidad base. El saldo corresponde al momento de cada movimiento, aunque filtre el historial.</p>
<div class="table-responsive"><table class="table table-hover small"><thead><tr><th>Fecha / tipo</th><th>Referencia</th><th>Presentación aplicada</th><th>Lote / vencimiento</th><th>Entrada</th><th>Salida</th><th>Saldo</th>{{#if esAdmin}}<th>Costo base</th>{{/if}}<th>Responsable / observación</th></tr></thead><tbody id="kardexRows"></tbody></table></div>
<button id="prevKardex" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Anterior</button><span id="kardexPageInfo" class="mx-2"></span><button id="nextKardex" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">Siguiente</button></div>
<script src="/js/gestion-ui.js"></script><script src="/js/kardex.js"></script>
